{
  "id": "1TH.4",
  "number": "4",
  "bookId": "1TH",
  "reference": "Tesalonikek 1 4",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 18,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "4",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1TH 4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "4",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kotigonutik che boisiei kotugul",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne bo let anyun, tupchosiechu, kesomok mising’ ak kiteeiywok eng’ Kiptaiyat Jesu, ko u ye kiotaach eng’ achek, ole kanyol obetite ak obaibaite Jehovah, agot ko u ye obendoti, si kobiit obaraitu mising’ inne. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu ongen ng’atutik che kigigonok achek eng’ Kiptaiyat Jesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu nito magetab Jehovah, noto katabaneng’wong’, si kobiit oistoege sokset. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Si kobiit konai chi tugul eng’ okwek komuch gei, korib bortanyi eng’ tililindo ak teegisto, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ma eng’ maget ne bo kasetab miat, agot ko u Bororiosiek che maingen Jehovah; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amat koyai chi kachiliilut anan koyachi ne ya tupchennyi eng’ ng’olyondonito: amu Kiptaiyat yaaktaindetab mugetut eng’ tuguchuto tugul, ko u ye kisib kiteeiywok ak kebaorian. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu kima kuurjech Jehovah simdo, ago eng’ tililindo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inendet ne esioi, ko maesio chi, ago Jehovah, ne konok Tamirmiriennyi ne Tilil.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.4.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago ma nyolu kesirwak agobo chamnyetab tupchosiek; amu onetotin okweget eng’ Jehovah si ochamnye; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amu oyae ko u noto iman eng’ tupchosiek tugul che mitei Makedonia komugul. Ago kiteeiywok, tupchosiechu, kele obaraitu kosiir; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak onetge otebi eng’ mutyonet, ak oyai boisionikwok, ak oboisie eunekwok, ko u ye kiging’atak; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "si obendate ko u ye nyolu eng’ taitab ichek che mi sang’, si mobanan kiy age tugul.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.4.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ole teptoi che kigobek",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago magimache anyun, che kitupche, oegu che mongen agobo icheget che ruitos; kele amoarogense, ko u bik alak che matinyei kamang’unet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu ngiyani kele kime Jesu ak kong’eet kogeny, ko u noto anyun eng’ icheget che ruitos eng’ Jesu, imutu Jehovah koboto inendet.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.4.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu kimwawok ni eng’ ng’olyotab Kiptaiyat, kele achek che kisoptosi, che ki ng’etunotin agoi nyonunetab Kiptaiyat, ko magoi kindoe ichek che kigoruiyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu chorugei Kiptaiyat inendet eng’ kipsengwet, koboto twegunet ne o, ak kutitab malaikaiyat ne o, ak iriagetab Jehovah: ak isib kong’eetos che kibek eng’ Kristo: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak achek anyun che kisoptosi, che ki ng’etunotin, keganabech koboto ichek eng’ bolik, ketuiye ak Kiptaiyat eng’ soet: ak ketebi anyun koboto Kiptaiyat koigeny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Noto anyun ogaigaige okwege eng’ ng’alechuto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.4.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
